## 🚀 Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/h-check.git
cd h-check
```

Make the script executable:

```bash
chmod +x hcheck.py
```

Run H-Check:

```bash
./hcheck.py
```

Python 3 is required.

---

## 💻 Usage

### Full diagnostic report

```bash
python3 hcheck.py
```

Runs the complete system diagnostic.

### Individual modules

```bash
python3 hcheck.py --system
python3 hcheck.py --hardware
python3 hcheck.py --storage
python3 hcheck.py --network
python3 hcheck.py --processes
python3 hcheck.py --services
python3 hcheck.py --security
python3 hcheck.py --health
```

### Run everything explicitly

```bash
python3 hcheck.py --all
```

### JSON output

```bash
python3 hcheck.py --json
```

JSON output can be useful for automation, external scripts and future integrations.

### Version

```bash
python3 hcheck.py --version
```

